These tests verify the Typer surface: that an unknown language is
rejected before any setup runs, and that a valid one produces the
expected [[.learnlog/]] directory.  We stub the Python pipeline rather
than exercise it here because its behaviour is checked separately, which
also keeps these tests independent of the network and the local Python
toolchain.

The home-directory guard needs the same treatment at the command
