is the order the log was written.
Sorting by start time instead would be tidier and would make the
listing disagree with what [[play]] pages through.
Runs can overlap---that is what the two-commit protocol is for
(\cref{sec:two-commit-protocol})---so a day can legitimately appear
twice, and when it does the repetition is evidence of two runs in
flight rather than a fault in the display.

