in an empty directory.
The run that follows the clone is what makes the difference visible:
with no files checked out, every file in the log reads as deleted, and
that deletion is what the run commits as the student's code state.

<<test functions>>=
def test_clone_checks_out_the_work_tree(
    workdir, pushed_log, monkeypatch,
