A target that names a file is the same refusal, and what the test is
really about is how it is delivered.
[[CliRunner]] keeps whatever the command raised, so asking for a
[[SystemExit]] is asking for a sentence rather than the traceback a
[[FileExistsError]] would have escaped as:

<<test functions>>=
def test_clone_refuses_a_file_as_the_target(
    workdir, pushed_log,
):
    """A target that is a file is refused, not a traceback."""
    from learnlog.cli import app
    from typer.testing import CliRunner
    target = workdir / "notes.txt"
    target.write_text("my work\n")
