@

The first thing to check is the one the old implementation got wrong
every time: a student with an uncommitted edit pulls, and the edit
survives byte for byte even though the incoming commit changes that
very file.
Listing the clone directory afterwards is the sharper half of the
test---a merge into the live work tree would have checked out
everything the other machine had, so finding nothing but the student's
own file says the merge went somewhere else entirely:

<<test functions>>=
